{"id":"o1-20","label":"I.20 Vile potabis","group":"Book I","blocks":[{"k":"v","lines":["Not large my cups, nor rich my cheer,","This Sabine wine, which erst I seal’d,","That day the applauding theatre","Your welcome peal’d,"]},{"k":"v","lines":["Dear knight Maecenas! as ’twere fain","That your paternal river’s banks,","And Vatican, in sportive strain,","Should echo thanks."]},{"k":"v","lines":["For you Calenian grapes are press’d,","And Caecuban; these cups of mine","Falernum’s bounty ne’er has bless’d,","Nor Formian vine."]}]}